
EXPERIMENTAL BLOK: CHANGELOG
============================

An effort was made to go through all the history to reconstruct the changelog,
since I was replaying git commits into svn. Previously the version numbers have
been all over the place - making it meaningless to use semver. This project has
been re-versioned with milestones instead.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
m8.0 (r???) 10-11-2026

* [feature] Implement svn revision as part of the window caption.
* [docs] Update versioning.
* [docs] Remove doxygen documentation:
	This is not required as the code is self-explanatory and always evolving. 
	Any complex topics will have inline comments.
* [repo] Ignore svn directory.
* [internal] Revert codename back to "Blok".
* [internal] Reformat and clean up code style.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
m7.0 (r471) 04-08-2025

* [fix] Fix spelling of "Sandstone".
* [fix] Fix arrow keys for square movement.
* [docs] Update doxygen documentation.
* [build] Add macro flag to instance mutex.
* [internal] Refine theme switcher.
* [internal] Remove --show-console flag.
* [internal] Update prefix from "blok" -> "st".
* [internal] Add ExitStatus enum for exit values.
* [internal] Update colour scheme.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
m6.2 (r405) 19-07-2025

* [feature] Implement random obstructable generation via O shortcut.
* [feature] Implement theme switch via T shortcut.
* [feature] Implement canvas lock via L shortcut.
* [feature] Implement grid visibility via G shortcut.
* [feature] Implement random set of obstructables via M shortcut.
* [feature] Implement panel visibility via I shortcut.
* [feature] Implement --scale argument for both the x and y scaling axis.
* [feature] Implement mouse down for rapid obstruct creation or removal.
* [feature] Implement single instance mutex.
* [feature] Update argument processor to ignore case.
* [visual] Update font to Segoe UI.
* [visual] Update panel sizing.
* [visual] Update colour scheme to use TailwindCSS colours.
* [fix] Update to use windowsx.h GET_{X,y}_LPARAM for mouse.
* [fix] Fix negative scaling values.
* [docs] Add doxygen documentation
* [debug] Add debug console.
* [internal] Switch to full unicode.
* [internal] Update message loop to use the non-blocking PeekMessage. 
* [internal] Update to use DrawText instead of TextOut.
* [internal] Update to set values to NULL after free.
* [internal] Update codename to "standstone" (misspelled).
* [internal] Update vector resizing.
* [internal] Implement runtime theme switching.
* [internal] Add wintype converter functions.
* [internal] Introduce context structure with subsystems.
* [internal] Extract program lifecycle functions.
* [internal] Add colour manager and enumerations to theming.
* [internal] Restructure folders.
* [internal] Update code style.
